questions.question_text:
A student creates a Node.js project with the following package.json configuration:
{
  "name": "my-app",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "main": "src/entry.js",
  "scripts": {
    "start": "node index.js"
  }
}

The project directory contains both `src/entry.js` and `index.js`. If another module in the same project executes `require('my-app')`, which file will Node.js load as the entry point?

